Package: levysim
Title: Simulation of Degradation Processes
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Amedée Rytrace", "Tito", , "rytracetito5@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Christian", "Paroissin", , "christian.paroissin@univ-pau.fr", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Exact simulation of one or several degradation trajectories
    of gamma, Wiener, inverse Gaussian, variance-gamma, Meixner and
    inverse gamma processes, homogeneous or not, at possibly irregular
    inspection times; plotting of the trajectories and extraction of the
    simulated data.
